## 11. Implementation Roadmap

| Phase | Scope | Duration | Priority |
|-------|-------|----------|----------|
| **0 — Foundation** | Docker Compose + NocoDB Schema + Users table | 2 days | 🔴 Critical |
| **1 — Task Sync** | ClickUp → NocoDB (one-way) + Slack/Discord thread creation | 3 days | 🔴 Critical |
| **2 — Comment Sync** | Bi-directional comment sync across all platforms | 4 days | 🔴 Critical |
| **3 — Status Sync** | Status change propagation + Lead Review workflow | 2 days | 🟡 High |
| **4 — Automation** | Keyword/Reaction commands with confirmation | 2 days | 🟡 High |
| **5 — Views** | NocoDB Views, Shared Views, Charts | 1 day | 🟢 Medium |
| **6 — Hardening** | Error handling, retry, monitoring, security audit | 2 days | 🟡 High |
| **7 — Testing** | End-to-end testing, load testing | 2 days | 🟡 High |

**Total estimated: ~18 working days**

